<VillagerDialog xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="https://vezel.dev/novadrop/dc/VillagerDialog VillagerDialog.xsd" id="20100" huntingZoneId="2501" voiceTypeId="0" xmlns="https://vezel.dev/novadrop/dc/VillagerDialog">
    <Text id="101" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] It is here.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Est&amp;#225; aqu&amp;#237;.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="102" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Come out now, God of Death!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Sal ahora, Dios de la Muerte!</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="103" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Hya!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Hya!</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="104" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] That&amp;#8217;s not important.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Eso no importa.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="105" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] You look pathetic without your body.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Te ves pat&amp;#233;tico sin tu cuerpo.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="106" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] If you promise me your cooperation, I will give you your body.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Si me prometes tu cooperaci&amp;#243;n, te dar&amp;#233; tu cuerpo.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="107" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Good. Come out.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Bien. Sal.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="108" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] You&amp;#8217;ll be much more powerful than what you are now if you unite your powers.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Ser&amp;#225;s mucho m&amp;#225;s poderoso de lo que eres ahora si unes tus poderes.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="109" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Do it, then follow me.&lt;BR&gt;I shall grant you even more power.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Hazlo, y luego s&amp;#237;gueme.&lt;BR&gt;Te conceder&amp;#233; a&amp;#250;n m&amp;#225;s poder.</Page>
    </Text>
</VillagerDialog>
